{"3739170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Police Force New Recruit", "steam_appid": 3739170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a rookie police officer and rise through the ranks in a city overwhelmed by crime, street racing, drug cartels, bomb threats, and terrorist attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Police Force: New Recruit</strong>, you will patrol dangerous districts, chase fleeing suspects, rescue civilians, defuse bombs, and eliminate high-risk threats across multiple city environments. From routine police patrols to intense tactical operations, every mission brings new challenges and greater danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive police vehicles through busy streets during high-speed pursuits, raid criminal hideouts, protect witnesses, stop human trafficking operations, and take down organized terrorist groups threatening the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete 26 action-packed missions across Metro City, Harbor City, Industrial Zone, Suburban District, and Capital City while using a variety of weapons and tactical equipment to restore peace and order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26 story-driven police missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person shooting and tactical combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed police vehicle pursuits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple city environments to patrol and explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb defusal and hostage rescue missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniper-based tactical operations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Criminal hideout raids and cartel takedowns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police progression from rookie officer to elite operative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of mission types including patrols, pursuits, raids, 